Subject: [PATCH 102/102] SableOS: SableOS version row in About phone

Add a SableOS version row above Android version in Settings > About
phone, built from ro.sable.release, ro.sable.base and
ro.sable.build_source (written by the Sable product layer). The LineageOS
version row and LineageOS legal information are unchanged and remain the
base attribution (DESIGN-KF-B Branding).
---
 res/values/strings_sable_about.xml            | 10 +++
 res/xml/my_device_info.xml                    | 10 +++
 .../settings/sable/SableBuildInfo.java        | 68 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../SableVersionPreferenceController.java     | 45 ++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 133 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 res/values/strings_sable_about.xml
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/sable/SableBuildInfo.java
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/sable/SableVersionPreferenceController.java

